<title>RUSSIA: Russia Nov aluminium output up four pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Nov aluminium output up four pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's output of primary aluminium rose four percent in November on a year ago, data released by the State Statistics Committee on Sunday showed.</p>
<p>The committee provided the following data:</p>
<p>			   METALS OUTPUT IN NOVEMBER 1996</p>
<p>			 month-on-month	  year-on-year</p>
<p>			 pct change		pct change</p>
<p> Primary aluminium     -0.4			 +4</p>
<p> Alumina		   -9			  -17</p>
<p> Rolled aluminium	-5			  -12</p>
<p> Nickel		    +6			   -3</p>
<p> Cobalt		    -1			  -27</p>
<p> Refined copper	  -4			   +4</p>
<p> Copper concentrate    +0.1			 -6</p>
<p> Gold		     -59			   +6</p>
<p> Zinc		     -23			  +19</p>
<p>NOTE: The committee did not release absolute production figures.</p>
<p>-- Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
